            "There are different possible ways to train task-specific models with LLM-rationales as output supervisions. One straightforward approach is to concatenate the rationale $\\hat{r}_i$ and label $\\hat{y}_i$ into a single sequence $[\\hat{r}_i, \\hat{y}_i]$ and treat the entire sequence as the target output in training small models, as considered in~\\cite{magister2022teaching,ho2022large}:\n",
